{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51460","headline":"赠妓（相牧庐州，有朝客留意饮妓，祖送短亭，妓车後至，相赠之曰：） · 敬相","name":"赠妓（相牧庐州，有朝客留意饮妓，祖送短亭，妓车後至，相赠之曰：）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"望断苏娘小小坡，竹埿金雁展轻莎。\n客卿幸有凝情意，何必临尊始转波？\n（《诗话总龟》二三《寓情门》引《唐贤抒情》）（〖1〗敬相，当作敬湘。\n《新唐书·宰相世系表五上》敬氏有「湘，庐州刺史」，爲敬括曾孙。\n《郎官石柱题名考》卷十六金部员外郎有敬湘，约咸通末年任。\n原列「无世次」作者，今移此。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"敬相","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51460.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51460","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}